{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40360","headline":"长安春日 · 曹松","name":"长安春日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浩浩看花晨，六街扬远尘。\n尘中一丈日，谁是晏眠人。\n御柳舞着水，野鸎啼破春。\n徒云多失意，犹自惜离秦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}